& & \hspace{-0.2in} \le \sum_{k=1}^M \sum_{m=1}^M (l_{g,m}^1-l_{g,m}^2)^+(n_{g,k}-n_{g,k+1}) \times  \log \left( 1 + \beta_g b_{g,m} / \left[ Q^b_g + \sum_{m=1}^k \beta_g b_{g,m} l_{g,m}^2 \right] \right) \nonumber\\
